OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, stabbed to death in
OL,4,A'pre-arranged' fight, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy was stabbed to death
OL,7,Fwith "severe force" after a fight was
OL,8,F"pre-arranged" on social media, a trial
OL,9,Fon the Isle of Man has heard.
OL,11,FChristopher McBurnie was pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene following the attack
OL,13,Fin Ramsey on 29 May last year.
OL,15,FA 15-year-old boy, who cannot be named
OL,16,Fbecause of his age, is accused of
OL,17,Finflicting the fatal wound and denies
OL,18,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
