OL,4,A'pre-arranged' fight, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the case for the prosecution,
OL,7,FDavid Temkin KC said while the defence
OL,8,Fteam would argue he had acted in
OL,9,Fself-defence, the attack had been
OL,10,F"deliberate and frenzied" with the
OL,11,Fintent to kill.
